WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.280
¿Quién es?

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.040
Walt?

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.200
How... how do you...

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.480
Never mind, stupid question.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.920
You're a toxic James Bond.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.880
What do you want, darling?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.840
Hey listen, do you know

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.320
where Gina is?

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.240
You're asking me about this?

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.560
She went to your family dinner.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.680
Maybe she lost in your Neverland.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.560
Are you drunk?

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.040
Am I?

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:53.480
Yes.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.760
I'm a drunk.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.120
All that week I was in

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.880
the center of attention.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.480
And now, no one gives

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:02.200
a damn about me.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.480
Is this the line from

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.760
Gone With the Wind?

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.040
Yeah, "Frankly, my dear,

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.720
I don't give a damn!".

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.680
So what do you want, sweetheart?
